### STEP 1 - Place a new order
POST http://localhost:8083/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userEmail": "john@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "productName": "iPhone 15",
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 79999.00
    }
  ]
}

###

### STEP 2 - Check notifications (wait 3 seconds after placing order)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/notifications

###

### STEP 3 - Check notifications for user
GET http://localhost:8085/api/notifications/user/john@example.com

###

### STEP 4 - Check notification for specific order
### Replace ORD-XXXXXXXX with actual order number
GET http://localhost:8085/api/notifications/order/ORD-E9D9A316